1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Daniël Diedericks (1912 - 1978)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Brief overview: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniël (65), known as Daan, originally from Rooiwal in Delareyville, died on 20th March 1978 in Klerksdorp. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Previously recorded as D. Diedericks  (66)  03/1978  Delareyville, NW)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Brief Biography:
2 CONT *'''Other Victims/Family
2 CONT *'''Funeral/Memorial
