2 CONT ==Additional Biographical Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://www.gendatabase.com/deceased-record.php?q=2642210&r=DANIEL&s=DIEDERICKS
2 CONT
2 CONT "Daniël (Daan) DIEDERICKS was born (25 Aug 1912) in Rooiwal, Delareyville, Wes-Transvaal, Suid Afrika. He died 20 Mar 1978 in Klerksdorp, Wes-Transvaal, South Africa and was buried 1978 in BP Delareyville, Wes-Transvaal, South Afr
2 CONC ica. Daniël married Aletta Catharina (Vossie) BOSMAN on 7 Apr 1941 in Leeudoringtad, Wes-Transvaal, South Africa." *https://archive.is/GwrmY
2 CONT
