2 CONT Orange Free State, Civil Deaths, Master's Office, Bloemfontein - Entry : 215/21742 - Registered Folio : 218/24945
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacobus Strydom van Brakel passed away on 29 September 1929 at his residence on the farm ' Bulhoek ' Reitz District. He was aged 26years and 1 month and a farmer who left movable property and assets of more than £ 300 and a will.
2 CONT
