1 NOTE {geni:about_me} NG Kerk, Kestell, Bethlehem District - Marriage Register Entry : 7/1937 
2 CONT
2 CONT  At the time of her marriage, Johanna was aged 23 years, and a spinster living in Kestell. Her husband, Jan Christiaan Nichols was aged 23 years, a bachelor and labourer ( Arbeider ) living in Springs, Transvaal.
2 CONT
2 CONT They were married after banns at the NG Kerk, Kestell on 13 July 1937 by presiding minister, Ds D.J.Faasen VDM in the presence of the following witnesses :
2 CONT
2 CONT G.H. Nichols / A.J. de Jager 
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription on Johanna's gravestone : Ps 121 ' Ek sal my oe na die berge opstaan, Waarvandaan sal my hulp kom ' Verse 1 tot 8
