1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Les and I went to the same High school, he was two and a half years older than me and sooooo goodlooking, all the girls fancied him, Les was an Excellent athlete and broke most of the school athetic records in the 
2 CONC hurdles and running events, except for the 1 mile, which was held by his older brother Donald. He was my best friend. We married in1957. Sadly we grew up in different directions. We were    divorced in 1974, Les remarried in Aug '
2 CONC 75 and George and I married in Dec. '75. Les died in Dec.'93, he had a malign brain tumor which was invasive , he was operated on and never regained conciousnes. He died 11 days later.
